OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to continue selling assets
OL,4,Ato clear debt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority with debts of #2bn
OL,7,Fhas approved the continued selling off
OL,8,Fof "significant" assets to reduce its
OL,9,Ffinancial blackhole.
OL,11,FWoking Borough Council (WBC), which
OL,12,Fwent bust in June 2023, has already
OL,13,Fincreased council tax and cut services
OL,14,Fin an attempt to make itself more
OL,15,Fsustainable.
OL,17,FOn Wednesday, its executive approved
OL,18,Ffurther sales, such as the town's
OL,19,Fgateway Triangle site and its
OL,20,FGoldsworth Park Shopping Centre, as
OL,21,Fwell as "a number of commercial and
OL,22,Findustrial holdings".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
