OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to continue selling assets
OL,4,Ato clear debt
OL,5,
OL,6,FDale Roberts, deputy leader and
OL,7,Fportfolio holder for finance and
OL,8,Feconomy, said: "The approved sales will
OL,9,Fgenerate much-needed income that will
OL,10,Fbe used to reduce our overall debt
OL,11,Fburden."
